---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Rinha4 ASM load balancer</p>
    <h1 id="hero-title">ASM is now the default YOLO load balancer.</h1>
    <p class="tagline">
      A shared transport bench for the .NET, C, and assembly Rinha4 stacks. The promoted image is x86-64 assembly; the C implementation remains as the pinned baseline for every regression and benchmark comparison.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions" aria-label="Primary actions">
      <a class="button primary" href={`${base}/docs/getting-started/`}>Use the ASM image</a>
      <a class="button" href={`${base}/reports/`}>Open comparison lane</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <aside class="proof-rail" aria-label="Current load balancer state">
    <div class="rail-header">
      <span>transport/lb</span>
      <strong>promoted default</strong>
    </div>
    <dl class="rail-list">
      <div>
        <dt>Default</dt>
        <dd><code>latest</code> points at ASM</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Baseline</dt>
        <dd><code>c-ci-&lt;sha&gt;</code> and <code>c-latest</code></dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Gate</dt>
        <dd>clean score first, p99 second</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </aside>
</section>
